day()}' -- "constructor call did not resolve to temporary object" (not yet
reduced).  Earlier notes:
libc++ (LLVM 18) <chrono>: drops __chrono/parser_std_format_spec.h:73-133
__validate_* (cpp_nested_name_specifier_ignores_hiding_variable: `__flags
__flags' then `__flags::__second'), __chrono/year_month_day.h:200-203
year_month_day_last's operator+= / operator-= ("symbol 'operator=' is
unknown" for `*this = *this + __dm;'; a header-free imitation passes), 212
operator local_days, 271/276/280 operator/ and 309 operator+ ("invalid
implicit conversion from 'struct year_month_day_last' to 'struct
